# headwear/cloth/headscarf: the Headscarf (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a kerchief drawn over the crown with a lit front hem, the hairline
# and the hair below it showing, tied at the nape in a knot whose two tails hang behind. Mask: the hair's top rows.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear headscarf
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q head 0
legend R head 1
legend S head 2
legend T head 3
legend U head 4

# (P5b SIG FR1) begin river-chaperon: the River T1 chaperon: the fat lapis roll, the cornette to the shoulder, the patte
legend ! plume 0
legend $ plume 1
legend % plume 2
legend & plume 3
legend * plume 4
view D key rest origin 1 -4 when sighelm-river,!helm.t2
